; C23  Winning 42 p. 37 (W42-p037-c), p. 40 (W42-p040-b), p. 41 (W42-p041-a);
; played in Hands 30 and 31 (pp. 103, 107)
; Rule, in our words: the bidder's partner, once on lead, leads his doubles.
; Python gate (pour_bidder gate_c9, "C23"): partner on lead holding a
; non-trump double; the book's tiles are those doubles.
; How this encoding differs: none. The book ranks the top unplayed tile of a
; suit with the doubles (p. 40); neither the gate nor this file does.
(policy c23-partner-leads-doubles
  (fallback lowest-legal)
  (rule lead-a-double (select answer)
    (guard
      (query
        (roles (chair b) (chair p) (domino doubled))
        (out doubled)
        (pattern
          (viewer p)
          (declarer b)
          (partner b p)
          (leader p)
          (next-actor p)
          (own-legal doubled)
          (double doubled)
          (not (in doubled q*)))))))
